# WebHandler — Web Server & API
# Files: src/coordinator/WebHandler.h, WebHandler.cpp

## PURPOSE
AsyncWebServer on port 80 serving LittleFS files and REST API. Captive portal via DNS.

## IP-LOCK ("Türsteher")
- isClientAllowed(req): Only one client at a time, 45s SESSION_TIMEOUT_MS
- activeClientIP, lastActivityTime, activeClientName tracked
- Blocked clients → redirect to /only1device.html

## API ENDPOINTS

### System
- GET /api/version → firmware version string
- GET /api/status → JSON array of all pucks [{active, id, mac, bat, rssi, ver, lastSeen, lastClick, clicks, time, temp}]
- GET /api/who_is_active → active client name
- GET /api/sysinfo → uptime, chip, heap, storage, WiFi info
- GET /api/heap → free/min heap
- GET /api/netstats → network packet statistics
- GET /api/netstats/reset → reset counters
- GET /api/fs_list → all LittleFS files

### License
- GET /api/license → {status, deviceCode, playtime_hours, playtime_limit_minutes}
- POST /api/register → body: key=XXXXXXXXX
- POST /api/license/debug → set debug time limits (PUCK_RACER_DEBUG only)
- GET /api/license/apply_time_key → auto-apply time extension (debug)

### Game Control
- GET /api/game/status → current game getStatusJSON()
- GET /api/game/load?id=N → GameManager::startGame(N)
- GET /api/game/action?cmd=X&val=Y → processCommand(X, Y) on current game

### Statistics
- GET /api/stats/games → {g1: count, g2: count, ..., g29: count}
- GET /api/stats/playtime → total minutes
- GET /api/stats/check?pids=1,2,3 → check if player CSV files exist
- POST /api/stats/player_save → append to /s_<pid>.csv (fields: pid, game, score, ts, ex1-ex5, extra)
- GET /api/stats/player_del?pid=N → delete player stats file
- GET /api/highscore/get?game=N → highscores JSON
- POST /api/highscore/save → save highscores JSON

### Puck Management
- GET /api/effects → current LED effects on all pucks
- GET /api/trigger_ota → force pucks into OTA mode
- GET /api/ota_status → OTA progress JSON
- GET /api/puck_reset → clear puck list
- GET /api/rssi_mode?val=0|1 → toggle RSSI visualization
- GET /api/quiet_mode?val=0|1 → mute puck sounds
- GET /api/brightness_limit?val=10-100 → max LED brightness %

### WiFi
- POST /api/wifi_config → save SSID/password, restart
- GET /api/wifi_info → current SSID + security
- GET /api/scanner/start?ch=N&dur=S → start WiFi scan
- GET /api/scanner/status → scan progress/results
- GET /api/scanner/restore → restore original channel

### Files
- POST /api/players → save players.json
- GET /api/players → load players.json
- POST /api/trainings → save trainings.json
- GET /api/trainings → load trainings.json
- POST /api/custom/save → save /custom_game.json (body handler for large POST)
- GET /api/custom/load → load /custom_game.json

### Audio
- GET /api/music_info → path to first .mp3 file
- POST /api/upload_mp3 → upload/replace MP3

### Upload & OTA
- POST /upload_file → upload to LittleFS (multipart)
- POST /upload_puck → upload puck firmware binary
- POST /update_system → OTA coordinator firmware

## FILE SERVING
- GET / → /index.html (or fallback welcome if LittleFS empty)
- Static files from LittleFS root, cache max-age=86400
- Default file: index.html

## CAPTIVE PORTAL
- DNSServer port 53 redirects all hostnames → 192.168.42.1
- Enables http://puck.racer access
